{"id":1953737,"name":"Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-InP-low-noise-MPS","description":"<h3 id=\"transfer-from-huggingface\"><strong>Transfer from huggingface</strong></h3><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-Reward-LoRAs/tree/main\">https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-Reward-LoRAs/tree/main</a></p><p>sample of workflow: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://www.runninghub.ai/post/1966777795378655234?inviteCode=rh-v1213\">https://www.runninghub.ai/post/1966777795378655234</a></p><p></p><h2 id=\"introduction\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p>We explore the Reward Backpropagation technique <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-Reward-LoRAs#ref1\"><strong><u>1</u></strong></a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-Reward-LoRAs#ref2\"><strong><u>2</u></strong></a> to optimized the generated videos by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://github.com/aigc-apps/VideoX-Fun\"><strong><u>Wan2.2-Fun</u></strong></a> for better alignment with human preferences. We provide the following pre-trained models (i.e. LoRAs) along with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://github.com/aigc-apps/VideoX-Fun/blob/main/scripts/wan2.2_fun/train_reward_lora.py\"><strong><u>the training script</u></strong></a>. You can use these LoRAs to enhance the corresponding base model as a plug-in or train your own reward LoRA.</p><p>For more details, please refer to our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://github.com/aigc-apps/VideoX-Fun\"><strong><u>GitHub repo</u></strong></a>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(11, 15, 25);color:rgb(179, 188, 201);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:14.7px\">Official MPS reward LoRA (</span><code>rank=128</code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(11, 15, 25);color:rgb(179, 188, 201);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:14.7px\"> and </span><code>network_alpha=64</code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(11, 15, 25);color:rgb(179, 188, 201);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:14.7px\">) for Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-InP (low noise). It is trained with a batch size of 8 for 4,500 steps.</span></p>","allowNoCredit":true,"allowCommercialUse":["RentCivit"],"allowDerivatives":true,"allowDifferentLicense":true,"type":"LORA","minor":false,"sfwOnly":false,"poi":false,"nsfw":true,"nsfwLevel":60,"availability":"Public","userId":1861085,"baseModels":["Wan Video 2.2 T2V-A14B"],"cosmetic":null,"supportsGeneration":true,"stats":{"downloadCount":528,"thumbsUpCount":26,"thumbsDownCount":0,"commentCount":0,"tippedAmountCount":0},"creator":{"username":"BBS_revenger","image":"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5afd26d1-de69-454a-8e59-d22589efda18/width=96/BBS_revenger.jpeg"},"tags":["tool","rewards lora"],"modelVersions":[{"id":2211200,"index":0,"name":"v1.0","baseModel":"Wan Video 2.2 T2V-A14B","baseModelType":"Standard","createdAt":"2025-09-13T13:12:10.344Z","publishedAt":"2025-09-13T13:32:50.914Z","status":"Published","flags":0,"availability":"Public","nsfwLevel":60,"covered":true,"stats":{"downloadCount":528,"thumbsUpCount":26,"thumbsDownCount":0},"files":[{"id":2104216,"sizeKB":838337.33984375,"name":"Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-InP-low-noise-MPS.safetensors","overrideName":null,"type":"Model","pickleScanResult":"Success","pickleScanMessage":"No Pickle imports","virusScanResult":"Success","virusScanMessage":null,"scannedAt":"2025-09-13T13:30:58.948Z","meta